Description: Desktop software for the TjipTemp ESP32-S3 thermometer board
 Control, logging and calibration software for a multi-sensor thermometer board
 carrying a PT1000 (2-, 3- or 4-wire via MAX31865), a type-K thermocouple
 (MAX31856), six NTC thermistors, battery and supply monitoring, and an AHT20
 humidity sensor.
 .
 Connects over USB CDC, WiFi or BLE, plots every channel live, records to a
 local database with fitted UTC timestamps, exports to CSV, Excel, Parquet and
 publication-quality figures, and exposes a documented REST and WebSocket API
 for other programs.
 .
 The board has no controls of its own, so its 240x320 display, its sensor
 configuration and its stored calibration are all driven from here.
